      "width": 160,
      "height": 46,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "n168",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "只选机械 = 整具机器",
      "x": 636,
      "y": 6888,
      "width": 184,
      "height": 46,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "n169",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "生物 + 机械 = 身上有机械部分",
      "x": 636,
      "y": 6944,
      "width": 256,
      "height": 46,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "n170",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "机械义体 = 机械 + 局部义体，不是单独的材质",
      "x": 636,
      "y": 7000,
      "width": 368,
      "height": 46,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "n171",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "触手是形态，可以长在任何材质上",
      "x": 636,
      "y": 7056,
      "width": 272,
      "height": 46,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "n172",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "缆线触手：形态是触手，材质是机械",
      "x": 636,
      "y": 7112,
      "width": 288,
      "height": 46,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "n173",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "虫群是形态，不是数量",
